WEBVTT

00:08.380 --> 00:11.330
<b>Futaba</b>

00:08.380 --> 00:11.330
<b>Mikuriya</b>

00:09.960 --> 00:11.380
<b>My name's Futaba Mikuriya.</b>

00:11.380 --> 00:13.580
<b>He's so cool!</b>

00:16.290 --> 00:17.630
<b>He's pretty handsome.</b>

00:18.210 --> 00:19.250
<b>Talking about me?</b>

00:19.500 --> 00:20.420
<b>No.</b>

00:20.710 --> 00:23.380
<b>I just got back from LA two days ago.</b>

00:23.920 --> 00:28.960
<b>Mikuriya has lived in America since middle school
because of his father's work.</b>

00:29.880 --> 00:35.420
<b>He might need help adjusting to Japan
after all this time, so help him out, okay?</b>

00:35.420 --> 00:36.670
<b>Of course!</b>

00:36.670 --> 00:37.540
<b>Sure!</b>

00:38.130 --> 00:40.080
<b>I've seen this reaction before...</b>

00:56.290 --> 00:58.670
<b>Sousa ore wa mezamete shimatta</b>

00:58.670 --> 01:01.500
<b>Tokubetsu na chikara motte shimatta</b>

01:01.500 --> 01:03.710
<b>Kono barrier no maeni wa</b>

01:03.710 --> 01:08.170
<b>Donna yatsura mo muryoku daze</b>

01:11.250 --> 01:13.960
<b>Tenshi ka akuma no umarekawari ka</b>

01:13.960 --> 01:16.750
<b>Mienai mono ga miete shimaunda</b>

01:16.750 --> 01:18.960
<b>Migiude ga uzukidashita</b>

01:18.960 --> 01:21.330
<b>Kakusei no toki wa mada hayai</b>

01:21.460 --> 01:24.130
<b>Kodomo janaisi otona demo nai</b>

01:24.130 --> 01:26.460
<b>Tetsugaku pierce buchi akete</b>

01:26.460 --> 01:30.250
<b>Kashiore karaage lemon o kaketara saa!</b>

01:30.540 --> 01:32.830
<b>(Nonde nonde nonde nonde)</b>

01:33.000 --> 01:35.330
<b>Kojirasechatte panpakapappappaan</b>

01:35.330 --> 01:37.830
<b>Kodoku to herikutsu no yami ni magirete</b>

01:37.830 --> 01:40.420
<b>Tokkouyaku wa mitsukaranai</b>

01:40.420 --> 01:42.790
<b>Otoko ni umareta shukumei dakara</b>

01:42.790 --> 01:45.630
<b>Hontou no jibun sagasu tame</b>

01:45.630 --> 01:48.130
<b>Hanate ore no searchlight!</b>

01:48.130 --> 01:50.540
<b>Kojirasechatte panpakapappappaan</b>

01:50.540 --> 01:53.000
<b>Risou to genjitsu no hazama de yureteru</b>

01:53.000 --> 01:55.580
<b>Kaiketsusaku wa miataranai</b>

01:55.580 --> 01:58.130
<b>Setsuna o musaboru unmei naraba</b>

01:58.130 --> 02:00.750
<b>Hontou no jibun sagasu tame</b>

02:00.920 --> 02:03.250
<b>Hanate ore no searchlight!</b>

02:03.250 --> 02:05.830
<b>Eternal Force Blizzard!</b>

02:11.790 --> 02:14.500
<b>Episode 4</b>

02:11.790 --> 02:14.500
<b>I've Got a Complication, There's a Fanfare in My Head</b>

02:15.290 --> 02:19.420
<b>I heard transferring here is harder
than taking the normal entrance exam.</b>

02:19.420 --> 02:20.830
<b>It wasn't too bad.</b>

02:21.380 --> 02:24.250
<b>You had a guitar case with you. Do you play?</b>

02:25.290 --> 02:27.580
<b>I don't do it to show off.</b>

02:28.330 --> 02:30.420
<b>Wasn't English difficult?</b>

02:30.750 --> 02:34.080
<b>My grandma's American so I've never had trouble.</b>

02:34.080 --> 02:35.580
<b>Wow!</b>

02:35.710 --> 02:38.580
<b>That's all just normal to me.</b>

02:39.210 --> 02:41.130
<b>You're so cool!</b>

02:41.130 --> 02:43.790
<b>Whew, that's quite a crowd.</b>

02:44.290 --> 02:49.420
<b>Meanwhile, I would've been a total loner
if Nanako-chan hadn't talked to me.</b>

02:51.880 --> 02:53.380
<b>What a nice girl!</b>

02:54.290 --> 02:58.210
<b>Well, if I cared at all I'd do much better than that.</b>

02:58.540 --> 03:02.080
<b>I cleared my Moegaoka High School
game earlier this morning</b>

03:02.080 --> 03:05.380
<b>with the miraculous feat of having
fifteen relationships at once!</b>

03:06.250 --> 03:07.580
<b>Yup, yup.</b>

03:07.830 --> 03:12.250
<b>Apparently Mikuriya-kun's dad is the
head of the J-Karaoke Group.</b>

03:12.250 --> 03:15.580
<b>What?! J-Karaoke's the sponsor for iLive!</b>

03:15.580 --> 03:17.540
<b>The head is God, practically!</b>

03:17.790 --> 03:19.580
<b>So that would mean...</b>

03:20.540 --> 03:21.830
<b>he's the son of God...</b>

03:21.830 --> 03:24.250
<b>That makes no sense at all...</b>

03:24.830 --> 03:26.420
<b>J-Karaoke's great.</b>

03:26.420 --> 03:29.830
<b>It has all the songs by Sora-chan,
Chinatsu, Sakura, Yayoi, Seiro, Awaji, Nagisa,</b>

03:29.830 --> 03:32.080
<b>They have lots of Vocaloid songs, too.</b>

03:29.830 --> 03:34.630
<b>Nanami, Usamaru, Harukaze, Akane, Yuko, Charlotte, and Leafa!</b>

03:32.210 --> 03:34.630
<b>Really? "Brain Fluid Explosion Girl" too?</b>

03:34.790 --> 03:39.250
<b>What's more, they're going to run a vinyl wrapped bus
with an iLive theme starting tomorrow!</b>

03:39.630 --> 03:40.750
<b>Uh-huh...</b>

03:41.630 --> 03:43.880
<b>By the way, Noda-kun's been awfully quiet.</b>

03:46.170 --> 03:49.880
<b>I've seen that crazy twinkling in his eyes before...</b>

03:53.880 --> 03:54.790
<b>What's up?</b>

03:55.380 --> 03:59.290
<b>I can tell. Futaba Mikuriya, you're...</b>

03:59.500 --> 04:00.670
<b>Green!</b>

04:00.670 --> 04:02.130
<b>I knew it!</b>

04:03.080 --> 04:04.210
<b>I'm Red!</b>

04:04.750 --> 04:06.130
<b>This is Yellow!</b>

04:06.130 --> 04:07.380
<b>Uh, hi.</b>

04:07.960 --> 04:09.380
<b>And this is Pink!</b>

04:09.880 --> 04:14.750
<b>Green, come join the Hero Club to exercise
some sweet justice with us!</b>

04:15.460 --> 04:17.080
<b>From the neighborhood to the nation,</b>

04:17.500 --> 04:22.540
<b>wherever there are people in need,
we willingly take on any mission and solve it!</b>

04:22.830 --> 04:25.330
<b>The keepers of justice known to a select few...</b>

04:25.790 --> 04:29.750
<b>The Hero Club</b>

04:25.880 --> 04:27.790
<b>That's the Hero Club!</b>

04:28.040 --> 04:29.670
<b>I'm not a part of this!</b>

04:30.710 --> 04:32.040
<b>What a load of nonsense.</b>

04:33.170 --> 04:34.380
<b>That's ridiculous.</b>

04:35.040 --> 04:40.750
<b>AC, AD, BC, and CD all equal 2.</b>

04:41.420 --> 04:45.130
<b>If so, what does "r" equal? Mikuriya, give it a go.</b>

04:45.330 --> 04:48.290
<b>Mathematics A</b>

04:45.540 --> 04:48.330
<b>"r" equals the square root of 13 over 3.</b>

04:48.330 --> 04:49.420
<b>He's right!</b>

04:49.420 --> 04:50.250
<b>Huh?</b>

04:50.250 --> 04:51.420
<b>Exactly.</b>

04:51.420 --> 04:52.630
<b>Wow!</b>

04:52.630 --> 04:54.330
<b>How did he figure that out?</b>

04:55.250 --> 04:57.330
<b>And he was looking at his phone the whole time.</b>

04:58.170 --> 05:01.130
<b>It's easy if you're familiar with Math IIB.</b>

05:01.880 --> 05:04.580
<b>"Route thirteen" sounds like
a secret passageway, doesn't it?</b>

05:04.580 --> 05:07.580
<b>How did you know he had the right answer
with that amount of knowledge?</b>

05:07.580 --> 05:08.880
<b>Yamato's amazing, you know.</b>

05:09.500 --> 05:12.920
<b>He skips over the calculations and
guesses the answer by sheer intuition!</b>

05:14.290 --> 05:18.170
<b>If the entrance exam wasn't multiple choice,
I would've never gotten into Minakami High!</b>

05:18.170 --> 05:20.170
<b>Noda. Sit down.</b>

05:20.460 --> 05:21.290
<b>Yes, sir!</b>

05:22.670 --> 05:24.130
<b>Thurs</b>

05:22.670 --> 05:24.130
<b>Math A</b>

05:22.670 --> 05:24.130
<b>Basic</b>

05:22.670 --> 05:24.130
<b>Biology</b>

05:23.210 --> 05:27.710
<b>In recent years, the Antarctic ice has
been undergoing changes.</b>

05:28.210 --> 05:30.000
<b>The surface ice melts...</b>

05:30.000 --> 05:35.380
<b>Angry, red-eyed Antarctic penguins have united
and are about to invade!</b>

05:35.380 --> 05:38.170
<b>It's all because of global warming!</b>

05:38.380 --> 05:40.540
<b>Wh-what are you talking about?</b>

05:41.130 --> 05:44.670
<b>We mustn't let such a tragic war begin!</b>

05:45.330 --> 05:47.880
<b>The only tragic thing here is your delusional mind...</b>

05:49.040 --> 05:51.080
<b>Noda. Sit down.</b>

05:51.080 --> 05:51.880
<b>Yes, sir!</b>

05:52.670 --> 05:54.670
<b>Art Room</b>

06:01.290 --> 06:04.210
<b>Yo, Green! Join the Hero Club!</b>

06:04.670 --> 06:08.580
<b>Be quiet. We're supposed to be sketching.
Keep it down.</b>

06:09.710 --> 06:13.710
<b>I wonder if Mikuriya-kun's good at drawing, too?</b>

06:15.210 --> 06:16.210
<b>Uh?!</b>

06:16.580 --> 06:18.960
<b>Is this avant-garde or something like that?</b>

06:19.420 --> 06:21.040
<b>Very "Renaissance," no?</b>

06:21.040 --> 06:24.290
<b>I-it's "artistic" and uh... pretty out there.</b>

06:24.290 --> 06:25.750
<b>Take a five-minute break!</b>

06:33.380 --> 06:34.880
<b>Pretty impressive, Green!</b>

06:34.880 --> 06:38.830
<b>Just as I expected! That thing's overflowing with power!</b>

06:39.500 --> 06:42.420
<b>You've got a good eye. I call it "Budding."</b>

06:42.670 --> 06:45.500
<b>I depicted the winds of May and unlimited energy.</b>

06:45.500 --> 06:46.500
<b>Huh...?</b>

06:47.460 --> 06:48.920
<b>I'm not getting any of that.</b>

06:49.250 --> 06:51.210
<b>Kirito Setsuna</b>

06:54.500 --> 06:55.540
<b>Adios.</b>

06:58.670 --> 07:01.420
<b>It's interesting that our cooking classes are themed.</b>

07:02.420 --> 07:04.290
<b>Last time it was "daikon radish."</b>

07:04.290 --> 07:10.580
<b>We were supposed to make furofuki daikon, and
Noda-kun started off making an entire tub. That was fun!</b>

07:04.290 --> 07:10.580
<b>Note: Furo = bath</b>

07:06.960 --> 07:13.130
<b>Hammer, hammer, hammer! Hammer, hammer, hammer!</b>

07:11.000 --> 07:13.130
<b>Wrong kind of "furo"...</b>

07:13.130 --> 07:15.580
<b>Home Economics</b>

07:13.540 --> 07:15.250
<b>Oh, this is it.</b>

07:16.920 --> 07:19.630
<b>Green! It's a cooking match!</b>

07:19.920 --> 07:21.380
<b>He's at it again...</b>

07:21.790 --> 07:24.380
<b>If we win, you join the Hero Club!</b>

07:24.790 --> 07:26.130
<b>No, thank you!</b>

07:26.130 --> 07:28.170
<b>See? I knew he'd say no.</b>

07:28.670 --> 07:30.630
<b>He's probably worried he'll lose.</b>

07:31.000 --> 07:33.630
<b>Delicious food is a universal language.</b>

07:34.000 --> 07:36.170
<b>It's not a bad way to settle things.</b>

07:37.130 --> 07:38.830
<b>Why are those two here, too?</b>

07:38.830 --> 07:42.250
<b>Because it's a special joint course with all three classes.</b>

07:42.830 --> 07:45.920
<b>Cooking is about the soul. There's no winning or losing.</b>

07:48.040 --> 07:49.250
<b>He's totally right...!</b>

07:49.790 --> 07:55.250
<b>I don't know. I think he just knows a fraction of
my genius is enough to crush him.</b>

07:56.250 --> 07:57.330
<b>Stupid.</b>

07:58.000 --> 07:59.000
<b>"Cupid"?</b>

08:00.380 --> 08:04.250
<b>[Idiot]</b>

08:00.670 --> 08:02.670
<b>He said, "stupid."</b>

08:03.250 --> 08:04.290
<b>Why you...</b>

08:04.880 --> 08:11.500
<b>You won't be acting like that for long.
I'll show you who the real boss is.</b>

08:12.670 --> 08:16.580
<b>Stop that! Mikuriya-kun just transferred here.</b>

08:16.580 --> 08:17.420
<b>Hmph!</b>

08:18.500 --> 08:20.210
<b>Attention, everyone!</b>

08:20.710 --> 08:25.540
<b>For today's cooking class, I'm going to have you
all make whatever you want with eggs.</b>

08:25.540 --> 08:27.330
<b>Did you all bring ingredients?</b>

08:27.330 --> 08:28.580
<b>Yes!</b>

08:29.000 --> 08:32.380
<b>Then you have thirty minutes to finish
your dish, beginning now!</b>

08:33.830 --> 08:39.880
<b>Pepper</b>

08:37.380 --> 08:39.880
<b>Huh? Are these quail eggs?</b>

08:40.210 --> 08:42.540
<b>Yup. I'm making Scotch eggs.</b>

08:50.000 --> 08:51.540
<b>He certainly has flair.</b>

08:51.540 --> 08:52.540
<b>That's huge!</b>

08:52.540 --> 08:53.540
<b>What is that?</b>

08:56.500 --> 08:58.250
<b>This is my egg!</b>

08:58.580 --> 08:59.710
<b>An ostrich egg?</b>

08:59.710 --> 09:04.330
<b>Isn't it big and awesome?
It's as big as twenty-five chicken eggs!</b>

09:05.170 --> 09:06.710
<b>Today's concept...</b>

09:07.670 --> 09:09.040
<b>is space monster...</b>

09:09.630 --> 09:11.710
<b>egg... cake!</b>

09:12.920 --> 09:15.880
<b>Huh. It won't break.</b>

09:17.710 --> 09:19.670
<b>GRRRRR</b>

09:20.040 --> 09:22.460
<b>Sounds like something's gonna break out.</b>

09:23.790 --> 09:27.000
<b>Does this mean... at the moment...</b>

09:29.330 --> 09:33.130
<b>I still don't have what it takes to crack this egg?!</b>

09:33.670 --> 09:36.750
<b>I'm going on a quest to find the legendary weapon.</b>

09:36.750 --> 09:38.500
<b>A-are you sure?</b>

09:40.130 --> 09:41.670
<b>He's such an idiot!</b>

09:41.670 --> 09:43.460
<b>Jeez, what an idiot.</b>

09:44.580 --> 09:48.130
<b>That's what happens when you try
to show off with unusual ingredients.</b>

09:49.330 --> 09:51.380
<b>What are you going to make, Tsukumo-kun?</b>

09:51.380 --> 09:53.290
<b>Note: Chawanmushi, a savory steamed egg custard</b>

09:51.540 --> 09:52.920
<b>Chawanmushi.</b>

09:53.290 --> 09:57.380
<b>That seems awfully involved for making in class.</b>

09:57.750 --> 10:02.210
<b>True, but I know a way. Within the time limit, too.</b>

10:02.960 --> 10:05.540
<b>Don't be startled when I'm done.</b>

10:07.170 --> 10:08.630
<b>I've gotta make my own.</b>

10:09.750 --> 10:10.540
<b>Okay!</b>

10:12.250 --> 10:13.630
<b>I've got this!</b>

10:15.130 --> 10:17.460
<b>Outburst Dreamer Boys!</b>

10:18.710 --> 10:20.580
<b>Outburst Dreamer Boys!</b>

10:26.710 --> 10:27.750
<b>Done!</b>

10:28.210 --> 10:30.880
<b>Finely scrambled egg, huh? Talk about ordinary.</b>

10:30.880 --> 10:34.580
<b>Making ordinary things tasty as usual is what I want.</b>

10:36.000 --> 10:39.250
<b>Is that sushi rice wrapped in egg? Or not?</b>

10:39.250 --> 10:40.420
<b>Actually...</b>

10:41.210 --> 10:44.710
<b>it's the kind of rice ball that Sora-chan said she likes.</b>

10:45.330 --> 10:46.500
<b>I see...</b>

10:46.920 --> 10:48.580
<b>His motivation's iffy.</b>

10:49.830 --> 10:50.630
<b>There!</b>

10:51.460 --> 10:55.670
<b>I call it..."Sora-chan's Happy Rice Ball"!</b>

10:55.670 --> 10:57.080
<b>Yay!</b>

11:02.130 --> 11:03.830
<b>I'll see you soon...</b>

11:11.330 --> 11:14.210
<b>Is Nakamura-kun making... egg drop soup?</b>

11:14.540 --> 11:18.960
<b>Indeed, although mine's made with rare phoenix egg.</b>

11:19.540 --> 11:24.580
<b>I also have bat skin dried over a
hundred nights, mandrake bulbs...</b>

11:24.580 --> 11:26.750
<b>Dried wakame seaweed and onion...</b>

11:27.250 --> 11:30.750
<b>To finish off, I'll add some powdered snake fang...</b>

11:31.210 --> 11:32.540
<b>and it's done!</b>

11:33.380 --> 11:34.710
<b>Ryushoin!</b>

11:34.710 --> 11:35.380
<b>Hmm?</b>

11:35.380 --> 11:36.710
<b>Can I try a sip?</b>

11:43.380 --> 11:46.830
<b>This... is... so... good!</b>

11:47.380 --> 11:49.670
<b>The silky egg gives the palate a smooth tickle,</b>

11:49.670 --> 11:53.580
<b>while the sweet onion and flavorful seaweed lends
it a depth that leaves you craving more!</b>

11:53.580 --> 11:56.330
<b>And this slight tartness I detect...!</b>

11:58.420 --> 12:00.040
<b>The flaming eyes of the Jabberwock.</b>

12:00.210 --> 12:01.580
<b>Tasty</b>

12:00.210 --> 12:01.580
<b>Pickled Plums</b>

12:00.540 --> 12:01.630
<b>You mean pickled plum.</b>

12:03.170 --> 12:04.630
<b>Wow!</b>

12:10.000 --> 12:13.250
<b>Damn it! The guy's just as annoying as ever!</b>

12:14.290 --> 12:16.170
<b>You've hardly done anything!</b>

12:16.380 --> 12:18.130
<b>I've already prepped everything.</b>

12:18.710 --> 12:23.250
<b>It just needs to be steamed three minutes on
high heat and ten minutes on low heat.</b>

12:23.790 --> 12:27.290
<b>So you're saying you need thirteen more minutes.</b>

12:28.830 --> 12:30.210
<b>Ten minutes left!</b>

12:33.290 --> 12:35.580
<b>I'm... three minutes... short?!</b>

12:37.000 --> 12:40.000
<b>I told you it wasn't a good recipe for class.</b>

12:40.540 --> 12:41.960
<b>Sorry for the wait!</b>

12:42.790 --> 12:43.960
<b>You don't have much time!</b>

12:44.170 --> 12:46.080
<b>Yellow, hold it in place for me.</b>

12:46.080 --> 12:47.380
<b>Okay, got it!</b>

12:48.630 --> 12:49.830
<b>Come on!</b>

12:49.960 --> 12:51.500
<b>Here we go...</b>

12:51.500 --> 12:53.790
<b>Yahhh!</b>

12:55.460 --> 12:57.380
<b>Take that!</b>

12:57.670 --> 12:59.880
<b>And that, and that, and that!</b>

13:01.750 --> 13:04.710
<b>Straight on the flames?!
How reckless can you possibly be?!</b>

13:05.130 --> 13:07.170
<b>Is this thing really edible?</b>

13:07.170 --> 13:11.170
<b>Based on my calculations, this should result
in a space monster egg cake.</b>

13:11.420 --> 13:13.710
<b>I put in plenty of yummy mix, too!</b>

13:11.880 --> 13:15.500
<b>Hotcake</b>

13:11.880 --> 13:15.500
<b>Mix</b>

13:13.710 --> 13:15.500
<b>The entire bag?! Use a measuring cup!</b>

13:18.080 --> 13:21.500
<b>Don't tell me... Hræsvelgr is about to emerge?!</b>

13:25.130 --> 13:26.460
<b>It's done!</b>

13:28.170 --> 13:29.460
<b>THAT'S HOT!</b>

13:33.790 --> 13:34.710
<b>There we go.</b>

13:37.790 --> 13:38.710
<b>What?!</b>

13:38.710 --> 13:39.710
<b>Move!</b>

13:40.880 --> 13:42.000
<b>What are you doing?!</b>

13:42.920 --> 13:47.290
<b>D-d-don't panic! I've heard that
throwing veggies in will put out a fire!</b>

13:47.290 --> 13:50.130
<b>Huh? Isn't it mayonnaise you're supposed to put in?!</b>

13:50.580 --> 13:52.170
<b>I brought a fire extinguisher!</b>

13:56.210 --> 13:58.000
<b>What are you doing at a time like this?!</b>

13:58.380 --> 14:00.460
<b>Exactly what I'm supposed to do!</b>

14:00.960 --> 14:03.170
<b>Stand back! You'll get burned!</b>

14:09.210 --> 14:14.960
<b>If you wring out a wet cloth and use it to shut out
the air, the fire will go out. Remember that.</b>

14:15.210 --> 14:17.170
<b>He's so cool!</b>

14:18.130 --> 14:21.710
<b>What are you acting all cool for? Are you an idiot?</b>

14:21.710 --> 14:23.080
<b>What?!</b>

14:23.790 --> 14:26.540
<b>Don't make a fuss with that noisy voice of yours, Rei.</b>

14:27.750 --> 14:28.580
<b>"Rei"?</b>

14:28.880 --> 14:31.830
<b>YOU'RE the noisy one, Futaba!</b>

14:32.500 --> 14:33.500
<b>"Futaba"?!</b>

14:34.580 --> 14:38.080
<b>You're on a first name basis? You guys must be tight!</b>

14:38.580 --> 14:40.710
<b>No! We're just cousins!</b>

14:40.710 --> 14:41.920
<b>Huh?!</b>

14:42.330 --> 14:45.540
<b>You were abroad. Why did you have to come back?!</b>

14:45.540 --> 14:49.580
<b>I would've selected another school
if I knew you were here.</b>

14:49.830 --> 14:53.460
<b>It's destiny! You can both be Hero Club members!</b>

14:53.880 --> 14:55.250
<b>Why would you think that?!</b>

14:58.460 --> 15:00.540
<b>You crushed my Scotch eggs.</b>

15:00.880 --> 15:01.880
<b>Go away.</b>

15:04.960 --> 15:08.420
<b>He just said he wanted to join the Hero Club, right?</b>

15:08.960 --> 15:14.380
<b>Definitely not, and I think he's really angry,
so you should go apologize properly.</b>

15:21.920 --> 15:24.630
<b>Did Mikuriya-kun forgive you?</b>

15:25.500 --> 15:26.580
<b>Nope.</b>

15:28.920 --> 15:33.330
<b>Once that guy holds a grudge, he doesn't let go.</b>

15:34.960 --> 15:36.500
<b>Hi-yah!</b>

15:36.880 --> 15:40.670
<b>How do I get Green to forgive me, Pink?</b>

15:41.170 --> 15:44.080
<b>It's your own fault. Figure it out on your own.</b>

15:46.080 --> 15:47.170
<b>I know!</b>

15:47.750 --> 15:50.630
<b>Entreat Thrice</b>

15:47.750 --> 15:50.630
<b>Toga Ryushoin</b>

15:48.170 --> 15:50.000
<b>We have to entreat thrice!</b>

15:51.630 --> 15:53.540
<b>"Entreat thrice," hmm?</b>

15:53.670 --> 15:58.290
<b>[Entreat Thrice]</b>

15:53.670 --> 15:58.290
<b>An idiom derived from classic Chinese texts,</b>

15:53.670 --> 15:58.290
<b>describing a person of higher status taking</b>

15:53.670 --> 15:58.290
<b>pains to welcome a trusty subordinate.</b>

15:53.670 --> 15:58.290
<b>[Origin]</b>

15:53.670 --> 15:58.290
<b>Based on the story of how Liu Bei paid</b>

15:53.670 --> 15:58.290
<b>Zhuge Liang three personal visits to recruit him.</b>

15:54.630 --> 15:58.330
<b>That's how Zhuge Liang conceded
to work for the warlord Liu Bei.</b>

15:58.750 --> 16:00.920
<b>I think it's good to be polite.</b>

16:00.920 --> 16:05.790
<b>Yeah! I'll treat him to three things
that he likes and apologize!</b>

16:00.920 --> 16:03.540
<b>Entreat Thrice</b>

16:04.710 --> 16:05.710
<b>Treat Thrice</b>

16:06.170 --> 16:08.460
<b>Close, but not that kind of "treat"!</b>

16:08.460 --> 16:12.880
<b>His favorite is from Satou, an established Japanese
sweets store the next station over.</b>

16:13.130 --> 16:16.000
<b>The ultra rare milk strawberry jelly yokan.</b>

16:16.460 --> 16:17.790
<b>"Ultra rare"?</b>

16:18.170 --> 16:21.040
<b>It's not like you to cooperate, is it?</b>

16:21.330 --> 16:22.290
<b>True!</b>

16:22.290 --> 16:23.750
<b>Hey!</b>

16:24.380 --> 16:27.170
<b>My big sisters really like Futaba.</b>

16:27.670 --> 16:30.580
<b>So if he were to tell on me...</b>

16:30.580 --> 16:31.880
<b>Ohhh.</b>

16:31.880 --> 16:33.210
<b>Don't react like that makes sense!</b>

16:33.330 --> 16:37.000
<b>Don't worry. I cast my memory removal spell Eraser</b>

16:37.000 --> 16:42.130
<b>such that none of us remember that
your sisters push you around every day.</b>

16:42.130 --> 16:44.000
<b>You guys totally remember!</b>

16:45.290 --> 16:49.380
<b>It's his first time back in three years.
He must want to eat some so bad it hurts.</b>

16:50.080 --> 16:53.250
<b>If we dangle that in front of him, I'm pretty sure...</b>

16:54.040 --> 16:55.210
<b>Know what I mean?</b>

16:57.710 --> 17:01.790
<b>It's the ultra rare milk strawberry jelly yokan mission!</b>

17:08.500 --> 17:10.790
<b>Waking up at 4 AM...is tough...</b>

17:11.040 --> 17:13.080
<b>Why...did I have to come too?</b>

17:14.000 --> 17:18.500
<b>You had to. They only sell twenty first come,
first served, one per person.</b>

17:19.000 --> 17:22.880
<b>Good thing we got here early!
We'll definitely manage to get three.</b>

17:22.880 --> 17:24.330
<b>You're still stuck on the "three" thing?</b>

17:24.960 --> 17:27.000
<b>But seriously, aren't you sleepy?</b>

17:27.290 --> 17:30.000
<b>I always wake up at 4 AM to train!</b>

17:30.380 --> 17:33.750
<b>I'm usually up at this hour packing lunches for the family.</b>

17:34.710 --> 17:39.330
<b>You sacrificed your family to come
buy milk strawberry jelly yokan?!</b>

17:39.330 --> 17:44.170
<b>Don't ruin my good name like that.
I packed them before I went to bed, so it's fine.</b>

17:45.040 --> 17:46.420
<b>What a good big brother!</b>

17:46.420 --> 17:47.250
<b>Yeah!</b>

17:48.920 --> 17:52.750
<b>By the way, where are Takashima-kun and Nakamura-kun?</b>

17:53.330 --> 17:57.420
<b>Yellow said the day has come when God is on his side.</b>

17:58.170 --> 17:59.290
<b>What does that mean?</b>

17:59.880 --> 18:04.210
<b>Nakamura said mornings are no good because
that's when his right arm throbs.</b>

18:04.210 --> 18:05.290
<b>Huh.</b>

18:07.500 --> 18:12.670
<b>Once we get the milk strawberry jelly yokan,
you have to apologize to Mikuriya-kun properly, okay?</b>

18:13.250 --> 18:14.290
<b>I know!</b>

18:15.130 --> 18:17.290
<b>The place opens at 8:00, huh?</b>

18:15.330 --> 18:17.250
<b>Friday</b>

18:19.130 --> 18:22.130
<b>Wait! School starts at 8:30, you know?!</b>

18:22.130 --> 18:23.330
<b>I guess we'll be late!</b>

18:23.670 --> 18:25.420
<b>Like I'd be that stupid.</b>

18:26.460 --> 18:27.170
<b>Huh?</b>

18:27.170 --> 18:29.670
<b>There's a bus that'll get us there in ten minutes.</b>

18:30.210 --> 18:32.420
<b>Tsukumo-kun, I bet your blood type A.</b>

18:32.420 --> 18:33.710
<b>How'd you know that?</b>

18:34.250 --> 18:35.330
<b>You're detail-oriented.</b>

18:36.920 --> 18:39.580
<b>As soon as we buy these, we make a dash for it, okay?!</b>

18:44.460 --> 18:45.420
<b>Bought them!</b>

18:45.420 --> 18:46.460
<b>We gotta run!</b>

18:46.460 --> 18:47.250
<b>Okay!</b>

18:52.250 --> 18:54.250
<b>Argh! Damn it!</b>

18:56.000 --> 18:59.330
<b>That was the last one that would've
just gotten us there in time.</b>

18:59.330 --> 19:01.420
<b>We'll just run faster than the bus.</b>

19:01.830 --> 19:03.750
<b>Only you can do that, Noda-kun!</b>

19:05.290 --> 19:07.330
<b>That's it. We're gonna be late.</b>

19:08.420 --> 19:09.540
<b>What do we do?</b>

19:08.790 --> 19:10.830
<b>My sisters are gonna kill me...</b>

19:09.540 --> 19:11.000
<b>It'll work out!</b>

19:11.000 --> 19:12.880
<b>Hey, good morning!</b>

19:12.920 --> 19:14.000
<b>Takashima-kun!</b>

19:15.750 --> 19:17.040
<b>You late too, Yellow?</b>

19:17.040 --> 19:19.790
<b>Nope. I'm meeting up with Sora-chan.</b>

19:20.210 --> 19:23.080
<b>How? I thought she was 2D?</b>

19:25.880 --> 19:28.380
<b>Oh! Here she comes! Sora-chan!</b>

19:28.880 --> 19:30.380
<b>So that's what you mean.</b>

19:31.540 --> 19:32.830
<b>iLive</b>

19:31.540 --> 19:32.830
<b>J-Karaoke</b>

19:32.880 --> 19:34.580
<b>iLive</b>

19:32.880 --> 19:34.580
<b>Get in on the craze!</b>

19:40.630 --> 19:41.710
<b>Like this?</b>

19:42.290 --> 19:45.920
<b>I got exclusive info that this extra bus was
going to run today, at this time!</b>

19:45.920 --> 19:50.080
<b>So that's why you wouldn't come line up with us
to buy the milk strawberry jelly yokan.</b>

19:51.790 --> 19:55.790
<b>It'll stop near the rear gate,
so we don't need to worry about being late!</b>

19:56.630 --> 19:58.920
<b>Seriously, what a waste of good looks.</b>

20:02.380 --> 20:03.290
<b>There's the rear gate!</b>

20:03.290 --> 20:06.000
<b>Great! My sisters won't kill me, after all.</b>

20:06.960 --> 20:09.290
<b>Shoomp! Go, go, go, go!</b>

20:12.250 --> 20:13.210
<b>He's so cool!</b>

20:13.210 --> 20:14.420
<b>It's Green!</b>

20:14.920 --> 20:20.750
<b>Being surrounded by the rabble this early
in the morning... I can't stand this much longer.</b>

20:23.880 --> 20:24.790
<b>What's that?</b>

20:28.040 --> 20:31.830
<b>Settle down... right arm!</b>

20:32.130 --> 20:35.380
<b>Black! Don't let Green get away!</b>

20:37.750 --> 20:39.670
<b>An enemy... you say?!</b>

20:40.170 --> 20:42.330
<b>Mist Splash!</b>

20:42.670 --> 20:47.000
<b>Splash... lash... lash...</b>

20:47.830 --> 20:52.710
<b>This is absurd, but I feel a groove that
exists between what's virtual and real.</b>

20:53.460 --> 20:57.500
<b>You sensed my pulsing energy?! Don't tell me you...?!</b>

20:57.830 --> 20:59.830
<b>Stop right there!</b>

21:00.210 --> 21:00.920
<b>Huh?</b>

21:01.880 --> 21:03.130
<b>Oh, whoops!</b>

21:05.000 --> 21:05.920
<b>Green!</b>

21:07.630 --> 21:09.790
<b>Say you'll join the Hero Club!</b>

21:10.790 --> 21:12.290
<b>Apologize first!</b>

21:12.790 --> 21:14.420
<b>What are you thinking?!</b>

21:14.670 --> 21:16.750
<b>You're supposed to apologize for the cooking incident!</b>

21:16.750 --> 21:17.630
<b>Come on.</b>

21:19.290 --> 21:20.960
<b>Just go ahead and apologize already.</b>

21:22.960 --> 21:24.000
<b>Right.</b>

21:25.540 --> 21:27.000
<b>I'm sorry about yesterday.</b>

21:28.630 --> 21:31.000
<b>Won't you eat this and join us?</b>

21:35.170 --> 21:36.210
<b>I see.</b>

21:37.420 --> 21:39.130
<b>Fine, I'll join.</b>

21:41.710 --> 21:42.750
<b>What?!</b>

21:43.330 --> 21:44.380
<b>Just like that?!</b>

21:45.330 --> 21:46.250
<b>Hmm?</b>

21:47.000 --> 21:50.750
<b>I'll join for the sake of these premium sweets.</b>

21:53.880 --> 21:56.580
<b>Now you're a member of the Hero Club, Green!</b>

21:57.580 --> 21:59.540
<b>A-are you sure?</b>

22:00.250 --> 22:06.670
<b>Yeah. I only live to savor these kinds of moments,
which are so hard to come by.</b>

22:04.040 --> 22:08.710
<b>Azayaka na melody kisetsu no kaze o matoi</b>

22:06.920 --> 22:07.790
<b>Hmm?</b>

22:08.250 --> 22:10.630
<b>Mikuriya-kun... That attitude...</b>

22:08.710 --> 22:11.790
<b>Boku o yonderu</b>

22:10.880 --> 22:15.630
<b>Isn't it awesome that we got six of us
before summer break, Pink?</b>

22:12.040 --> 22:19.250
<b>Afuredasu rhythm kutsuoto mo kasoku shite</b>

22:16.040 --> 22:17.960
<b>I-I guess.</b>

22:18.380 --> 22:20.210
<b>All I feel is anxiety!</b>

22:19.670 --> 22:27.500
<b>Utsumuiteru dakeja tsukamenai nanika sagashi ni yukou</b>

22:21.040 --> 22:21.790
<b>Class!</b>

22:21.790 --> 22:22.880
<b>That's right!</b>

22:24.250 --> 22:26.040
<b>Gotta hurry!</b>

22:27.670 --> 22:37.750
<b>Donna takai kabe demo kimi to yukunara kitto toberu sa</b>

22:38.170 --> 22:40.460
<b>Let's get started! All right?</b>

22:40.790 --> 22:44.710
<b>We still have a long long way to go</b>

22:44.710 --> 22:47.920
<b>Egaita sono tsubasa de</b>

22:47.920 --> 22:51.710
<b>Keep flying and to story</b>

22:51.960 --> 22:56.580
<b>Ashita o kakeru kara</b>

22:56.580 --> 23:00.710
<b>We still have a long long way to go</b>

23:00.710 --> 23:04.040
<b>Kienai sono kodou wa</b>

23:04.040 --> 23:07.960
<b>Keep trying and to story</b>

23:07.960 --> 23:11.630
<b>Kasanaru harmony</b>

23:11.790 --> 23:17.420
<b>Dare no mono demonai miraizu wa</b>

23:17.790 --> 23:22.790
<b>Kimi to tsuzutteku</b>

23:26.920 --> 23:29.080
<b>This summer, I'm gonna be a Blasto Ranger!</b>

23:27.750 --> 23:29.170
<b>Next episode preview!!!!</b>

23:29.080 --> 23:30.420
<b>Oh, you're going to work a gig in a hero show?</b>

23:29.130 --> 23:31.330
<b>I'm gonna be "xxx"!!!!</b>

23:29.330 --> 23:31.580
<b>###This comment has been removed###</b>

23:29.460 --> 23:31.330
<b>Come shake hands with me!</b>

23:30.420 --> 23:31.750
<b>They've got a job for you too, Pink!</b>

23:31.750 --> 23:35.130
<b>Uh, no. I want to stay in an air conditioned room
and indulge in my hobby of jigsaw puzzles-</b>

23:31.830 --> 23:34.080
<b>I plan to live on unearned income.</b>

23:32.500 --> 23:34.670
<b>Easy profit just by living.</b>

23:32.920 --> 23:35.080
<b>But I don't wanna work!!!!</b>

23:34.040 --> 23:36.040
<b>I'd toil away for my #1.</b>

23:35.130 --> 23:36.580
<b>They say they'll pay us 1.5 times the norm.</b>

23:36.580 --> 23:37.630
<b>I'm your person!</b>

23:36.830 --> 23:39.540
<b>Let me do it! Then onto Summer Comiket...</b>

23:36.880 --> 23:38.460
<b>A job idolizing my idol.</b>

23:37.040 --> 23:38.330
<b>Excitement's  ↑↑</b>

23:37.040 --> 23:37.830
<b>I'll go.</b>

23:37.040 --> 23:38.330
<b>One panel before the fall</b>

23:37.040 --> 23:39.080
<b>Please let me work here!</b>

23:37.050 --> 23:38.330
<b>I'm your person!</b>

23:37.050 --> 23:39.170
<b>Seems like we're at a theme park!</b>

23:37.630 --> 23:40.420
<b>Next episode: "I'm Burdened with Great Power."</b>

23:37.630 --> 23:38.420
<b>Take me!</b>
